    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this magnificent ground floor apartment in the residential development An Silin, Cappagh Road, Knocknacarra, Galway. \n\nAn Silin is a well maintained secure gated complex, containing just 15 modern apartments in secure grounds. The complex is exceptionally well maintained with landscaped communal areas & underground parking. \n\nSuperbly located on the Cappagh Road, just a 2-minute walk from the Cappagh Recreational Park, which contains walkways into Barna Woods, and just 5 minutes from Rusheen Bay on the Barna Road. \n\nThere is also a host of retail shops & restaurants within proximity such as Sheridan's Bar & Restaurant, Clybaun Hotel, Tesco supermarket, and the Gateway Retail Park. \n\nJust a 10-minute drive or less will bring you to the Salthill Promenade, Silverstrand beach, Barna Village, Galway City Centre, University of Galway, UCHG. \n\nNo.8 An Silin is presented in excellent condition, having been well maintained over the years by the current owner. Great attention to detail & décor is evident immediately upon entry. \n\nBenefitting from own door access, leding into the entrance porch and then to an open-plan lounge & dining area with feature wooden flooring and a modern fitted kitchen. \n\nThe property also offers two double bedrooms and a main bathroom. In addition to this, each apartment has their own storage shed to the rear of the complex. \n\nThis property is ideal as a first-time buyer residence, holiday home or gilt-edged investment, due to its convenient location within minutes of a host of local schools, shops & sporting facilities, as well as the excellent condition on offer. \n\nThere is a great local bus route to and from the city centre, with the bus stop conveniently positioned opposite the main entrance of the development. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
